@MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Playback statistics (requires a signed-in session)
GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/statistics
Accept: application/json

### Genres from available track tags and audio analysis (requires a signed-in session)
GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/genres

### Genres with tag and audio-analysis sources (requires a signed-in session)
GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/genres/sources
Accept: application/json

### Filter available tracks by genre, text, and listening state
GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/browse?genre=Rock&query=&status=unplayed&page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

### Invalid search filter
GET {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/browse?status=unknown
Accept: application/json

### Find a similar track outside a queue (requires a signed-in session and CSRF token)
POST {{MusicPlayer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/playback/similar
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"trackId": 1, "excludedTrackIds": [1, 2, 3]}
